{"title":"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a45e3d817886b4d9dbd6bb74ad23463ed139ed68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" /> positive integers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/e/f5e10e5f3aa7c766cb27c3ad319fa526f71588cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> more than the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> positive integers, then the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/1/b417a127620d5b467fe7a48ad5f7d843e5c390b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> positive integers is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/1/871b25a8655c28554a1f14b947d8d0f762dd1080.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 300\\quad \\text{(B) } 350\\quad \\text{(C) } 400\\quad \\text{(D) } 450\\quad \\text{(E) } 600$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"354\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can setup our first equation as\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/8/8a82b59c50008f0db87c6e249c410121205427a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3n(3n+1)}{2} = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2} + 150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"233\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/7235d95d78e63ab411521d130566a1b6afe2d46a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9n^2 + 3n = n^2 + n + 300 \\Rightarrow 8n^2 + 2n - 300 = 0 \\Rightarrow 4n^2 + n - 150 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"547\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>So our roots using the quadratic formula are\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/6/1867d2e33fc85ff11456c569d1844ac7825cb769.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a} \\Rightarrow \\dfrac{-1\\pm\\sqrt{1^2 - 4\\cdot(-150)\\cdot4}}{2\\cdot4} \\Rightarrow \\dfrac{-1\\pm\\sqrt{1+2400}}{8} \\Rightarrow 6, -25/4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"617\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Since the question said positive integers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/2/e326b48726d4c73525c3b980409600fd87ea9846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 6$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/c/0dc6fdca33d787d0f03f893843d46d170a866e13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/1/ea1a0a6932d26a62ba36b53a86e63a5a0c1442d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24\\cdot 25}{2} = 300$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"104\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/386255c1da145bc497cf598169ccbaa210e8d0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expressing as an equation:\n\\begin{equation}\\tag{1}\\frac{3n(3n+1)}{2} = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2} + 150.  \\end{equation}\n</p><p>The sum of the first 4n positive integers =\n\\begin{equation}\\tag{2}\\frac{4n(4n+1)}{2}\\end{equation}\n</p><p>We will try to rearrange Equation (1) to give equation (2)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/7/0b7f6d626a549e8dcc032e92961305e2399a7a8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3n(3n+1)}{2} - \\frac{n(n+1)}{2} = 150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"236\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/d/e3d863197cc444074e3fabebbf80af3182956c5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{n(3(3n+1)-(n+1))}{2} = 150 =\\frac{n(9n+3-n-1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"424\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/1/e71623db71c62e120784f0e4bd66a4c9c5122927.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(8n+2)}{2}= \\frac{2n(4n+1)}{2}  = 150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"247\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/2/cb244e51695a55f8707f342bea27a4cf13ee10e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4n(4n+1)}{2} = 2*150 = 300$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"221\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>300 is the answer\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/386255c1da145bc497cf598169ccbaa210e8d0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><br />\n〜Melkor\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME\" title=\"1970 AHSME\">1970 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1970 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1970\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=